<details class="panel technology-tree" {{ tree_standalone|default(false)?'open':'' }}><summary>Arbre technologique <span>{{ cards.technologies|length }} recherches</span></summary><p>Chaque rang possède son propre niveau. Les rangs Basique, Intermédiaire et Supérieur restent actifs en parallèle.</p><div class="technology-tiers">{% for tier,nodes in technology_tree %}<div class="technology-tier"><h2>{{ {basic:'Basique',intermediate:'Intermédiaire',superior:'Supérieur'}[tier] }}</h2>{% for node in nodes %}<article id="tech-{{ node.definition.slug }}-{{ tier }}" class="tech-node {{ node.available?'available':'' }}"><div class="tech-prerequisites">{% for requirement in node.prerequisites %}<a class="{{ requirement.met?'met':'' }}" href="{{ path('app_colony',{id:planet.id,section:requirement.group=='technologies'?'technologies':'buildings'}) }}#item-{{ requirement.slug }}-{{ requirement.tier }}">{{ requirement.met?'✓':'○' }} {{ requirement.label }} · niveau {{ requirement.level }}</a>{% endfor %}</div><span class="tech-connector" aria-hidden="true">↓</span><a class="tech-name" href="{{ path('app_colony',{id:planet.id,section:'technologies'}) }}#item-{{ node.definition.slug }}-{{ tier }}">{{ node.definition.label }}</a><span class="badge">Niveau {{ node.level }}{% if node.definition.max_level is defined %} / {{ node.definition.max_level }}{% endif %}</span><small>{{ node.available?'Prérequis remplis':'Prérequis à atteindre' }}</small></article>{% endfor %}</div>{% endfor %}</div></details>